---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout currentPage="privacy" title="Privacy Policy - Yahao Translate">
  <Header currentPage="privacy" />
  <main>
    <article class="privacy-page">
      <div class="privacy-container">
        <header class="privacy-header">
          <h1 class="privacy-title">Yahao Translate Privacy Policy</h1>
          <p class="privacy-date">Last Updated: October 16, 2026</p>
        </header>
        
        <div class="privacy-content">
          <p>Yahao Translate helps merchants translate content in Shopify Translate &amp; Adapt. This policy explains what data the extension uses and why.</p>
          <p><strong>Translation content.</strong> When you use a translation feature, the extension reads the relevant Shopify fields and sends the text to our service on Supabase, which forwards it to Alibaba Cloud's AI models to generate a translation. The result is returned to the extension for use in Shopify. We do not store submitted translation text as part of our usage records, and we do not collect your general browsing history or content from unrelated websites.</p>
          <p><strong>Account and usage data.</strong> If you sign in, we process your email address, authentication information, plan status and translation usage. If you use the extension as a guest, we use a device identifier and IP-derived security signals to enforce limits and prevent abuse. We record operational data such as the model used, request status and token counts, but not the text submitted for translation.</p>
          <p><strong>Glossary.</strong> If you save glossary terms, they are stored with your account so they can be applied to future translations. You can manage or delete them in the extension.</p>
          <p><strong>Payments.</strong> Pro checkout is handled by Lemon Squeezy. We receive information needed to manage your subscription, such as its status and transaction identifiers. The extension does not collect your full payment-card details.</p>
          <p><strong>Service providers and storage.</strong> Supabase provides authentication and data storage; Alibaba Cloud processes translation requests; Lemon Squeezy handles payments. Google may process information when you choose Google sign-in. We use these services only to provide and protect the extension, not for advertising or selling your data. Information received from Google APIs is handled in accordance with the Chrome Web Store User Data Policy, including its Limited Use requirements.</p>
          <p><strong>Retention and your choices.</strong> We keep account, glossary, subscription and usage records for as long as needed to provide the service and meet applicable security or legal obligations. To request access to or deletion of your data, contact us through <a href="https://www.yahaotranslate.com/contact">our contact page</a>.</p>
          <p>We may update this policy as the service changes. The current version will be available on this page.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .privacy-page {
    padding: 60px 0 var(--section-spacing);
    background-color: var(--color-background);
  }
  
  .privacy-container {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }
  
  .privacy-header {
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }
  
  .privacy-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 42px);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-text-dark);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  
  .privacy-date {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
  }
  
  .privacy-content {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text-dark);
  }
  
  .privacy-content h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 40px 0 16px;
  }
  
  .privacy-content h3 {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 24px 0 12px;
  }
  
  .privacy-content p {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  
  .privacy-content ul {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    padding-left: 24px;
  }
  
  .privacy-content li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  
  .privacy-content ul ul {
    margin-top: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  
  .privacy-content a {
    color: var(--color-text-dark);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  
  .privacy-content a:hover {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }
  
  .notice {
    background-color: #FFF8E1;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin: 24px 0;
  }
  
  .notice p {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  
  .notice ul {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .privacy-page {
      padding: 40px 0 var(--section-spacing);
    }
    
    .privacy-container {
      padding: 0 16px;
    }
    
    .privacy-header {
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    
    .privacy-content {
      font-size: 15px;
    }
    
    .privacy-content h2 {
      font-size: 20px;
      margin: 32px 0 12px;
    }
    
    .privacy-content h3 {
      font-size: 16px;
    }
  }
</style>
